direction: down

alert: Alert fires
triage: On-call triages
sev: Severity? {shape: diamond}
page: Page incident commander
fix: Apply fix or rollback
monitor: Monitor 30 min
resolved: Resolved? {shape: diamond}
postmortem: Write post-mortem
close: Close alert

alert -> triage
triage -> sev
sev -> page: SEV-1/2
sev -> fix: SEV-3+
page -> fix
fix -> monitor
monitor -> resolved
resolved -> postmortem: yes
resolved -> fix: no, iterate
postmortem -> close
